    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald O'Donovan are delighted to present this exquisite five-bedroom detached residence to the market. Set on beautifully maintained grounds, this impressive home offers spacious living, elegant modern interiors, and an abundance of natural light throughout. Outside, equestrian enthusiasts will appreciate the well-appointed stables and professionally designed floodlit sand arena, perfect for training and leisure riding. Nestled in the picturesque countryside of Walshtown, just outside Midleton. This impressive home enjoys a tranquil rural setting, while remaining within easy reach of essential amenities of Midleton and Cork City.\n \nApproached via a private entrance, this outstanding country residence occupies a beautifully secluded setting on meticulously maintained grounds. The property has been thoughtfully designed with family in mind, offering a perfect balance of elegant contemporary living and rural tranquillity. Extending to generous proportions of 264 sqm (2,842 sqft), the accommodation is flooded with natural light and finished to an excellent standard.\n \nAccommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hall, bright and attractive front living room, and a superb open-plan kitchen and dining area, leading to sunroom, utility, w.c., walk in cloakroom, study/bedroom, further study, four double bedrooms, family bathroom and master en-suite/walk-in wardrobe. This home is designed for modern family living and entertaining. Feature panelling is but some of the quality finishes and tasteful decor throughout. The flexible layout provides four/five generously proportioned bedrooms, offering ample space for growing families, home working, or guest accommodation. The property further benefits from underfloor heating throughout, and is setup for easy installation of solar panels, offering excellent potential for future energy enhancements. Storage is in abundance via a Stira staircase leading to a fully floored attic space, with conversion an easy possibility. \n \nThe grounds are equally impressive, with mature, beautifully maintained gardens surrounding the residence and creating a peaceful countryside setting. A substantial detached garage with mahogany doors extending to approximately 48 sq. m., provides excellent storage and practical space. \nFor those with an interest in equestrian pursuits, the property is exceptionally well-equipped, featuring six well-maintained stables, tack room, store room and a professionally designed floodlit sand arena, ideal for schooling, exercising horses or simply enjoying leisure riding.\n \nOffering a wonderful balance of country living and modern convenience, this outstanding home combines excellent equestrian facilities, energy-efficient features and a highly accessible location within easy reach of Midleton and Cork City. Rarely does a property of this calibre come to the market in East Cork, making it a superb opportunity for those seeking a distinctive family home in a truly special setting.\n\nVideo to follow"
      },
      {
